Sentence simplification is the task of simplifying a sentence to make it easier to understand. This can be done by reducing the complexity of the sentence, such as by removing unnecessary words or rephrasing complex phrases. Sentence simplification can be useful for a variety of applications, such as helping people with reading difficulties or improving the readability of text.

